    {
      "id": "7c7c4809-22c3-4a5a-a479-eae225b774c3",
      "name": "Normalize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "m",
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.message ?? $json.message ?? \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "n",
              "name": "client_name",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.client_name ?? $json.client_name ?? \"\" }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "s",
              "name": "system",
              "value": "You are the Business Model specialist of an AI executive team serving founders in Saudi Arabia. You are bilingual (Arabic/English) and reply in the client language, default Saudi Arabic. For any idea or business, design a clear model: value proposition, target customer segments, revenue streams, key channels, cost structure, and illustrative unit economics. Summarize as a lean business-model-canvas view when useful. Any numbers you give are ILLUSTRATIVE ranges only — you never commit a final price or a binding financial figure. Recommend the next practical step and which specialist should act. Separate recommendation from execution; pricing and spend need human approval. Never request passwords or OTP. Be concrete and structured.",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "adc61366-299d-4c36-86f1-f7e9c9e845a5",
      "name": "Model LLM",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $(\"Normalize\").first().json.message }}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "type": "SystemMessagePromptTemplate",
              "message": "={{ $(\"Normalize\").first().json.system }}\n\nLANGUAGE (STRICT): Always reply in the SAME language as the client's LATEST message — English message → reply entirely in English; Arabic message → reply in Arabic (Saudi tone); mixed → follow the dominant language, and switch immediately whenever the client switches. Wrapper text or metadata around the message (client-name prefixes, internal-consult notes, Arabic labels) must NOT influence the reply language — judge only from the client's own words."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "69c1b415-605c-48bf-ae9f-d60b9c934f7a",
      "name": "Format Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "let text='';try{const q=$('Model LLM').first().json;if(q){if(typeof q.text==='string'&&q.text)text=q.text;else if(typeof q.output==='string'&&q.output)text=q.output;else if(q.response&&typeof q.response.text==='string')text=q.response.text;}}catch(e){}const engine_fallback=!text;if(engine_fallback)text='وصلني طلبك وسأساعدك. جرب مرة ثانية بعد لحظات.';return [{json:{agent:'model',reply:text.trim(),engine_fallback}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "70b3aba7-b743-4669-99e6-31fe3d40a085",
      "name": "Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ agent: \"model\", reply: $(\"Format Reply\").first().json.reply, engine_fallback: $(\"Format Reply\").first().json.engine_fallback === true }) }}"
      }
    },
    {
